Package: tidyonnx
Title: Native ONNX Serialization and Runtime Inference
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Joao B. G.", "de Brito", email = "joao@sabby.com.br",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts numerical XGBoost tree ensembles to the Open Neural
    Network Exchange format and executes supported numeric tensors through
    the ONNX Runtime C API. Provides S7 model objects, session restoration,
    predictable tabular predictions, and direct workflow fit artifacts using
    a cpp11 bridge. Installation downloads a verified, package-private CPU
    runtime from the official fixed release.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/JoaoSabby/tidyonnx
BugReports: https://github.com/JoaoSabby/tidyonnx/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: S7 (>= 0.2.0), tibble, jsonlite, digest, stats, generics, utils
LinkingTo: cpp11
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), xgboost (>= 1.7.0), workflows, hardhat,
    parsnip, recipes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: C17 (USE_C17), C++17; ONNX Runtime 1.31.1 (downloaded at install)
NeedsCompilation: yes
ByteCompile: true
